@HostAddress = http://localhost:5084

### 1. Create a User
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sanad Rahahleh",
  "email": "sanad@example.com"
}

### 2. Get All Users
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Users
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a Resource
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Meeting Room A",
  "type": "Room"
}

### 4. Get All Resources
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Resources
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create a Booking
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": 1,
  "userId": 1,
  "startDateTime": "2026-09-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endDateTime": "2026-09-10T12:00:00Z"
}

### 6. Get Bookings (with Paging and Sorting)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Bookings?resourceId=1&from=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-09-30T23:59:59Z&page=1&pageSize=10&sortBy=StartDateTime&sortOrder=asc
Accept: application/json

### 7. Cancel a Booking
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Bookings/1

